---
import ProfileLayout from '../../layouts/ProfileLayout.astro';
---
<ProfileLayout title="Perfil | Cristian Bravo">
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1120px] px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr,0.9fr]">
        <div class="grid gap-4">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-500 dark:text-brand-mutedStrong">
            Director técnico - CYSTEMS
          </p>
          <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-transparent sm:text-4xl bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-purple via-brand-blue to-brand-purple bg-clip-text">
            Cristian Bravo
          </h1>
          <p class="max-w-xl text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-muted sm:text-lg">
            Líder técnico enfocado en arquitectura de plataformas, automatización y escalabilidad en la nube para
            empresas que buscan resultados sólidos.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-gradient px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-xl focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-purple/50 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-slate-50 dark:shadow-glow dark:focus-visible:ring-offset-brand-bg"
              href="/contacto"
            >
              Contactar
            </a>
            <a
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200/70 bg-white/70 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:border-brand-purple/40 hover:text-slate-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-purple/40 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-slate-50 dark:border-brand-purple/40 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-brand-text dark:hover:border-brand-purple/60 dark:focus-visible:ring-offset-brand-bg"
              href="/proyectos"
            >
              Ver proyectos
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-brand-purple/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-purple/10 via-white/80 to-white p-6 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10 backdrop-blur-sm before:absolute before:inset-0 before:rounded-3xl before:border before:border-brand-purple/20 before:opacity-40 before:content-[''] dark:border-brand-purple/40 dark:bg-gradient-to-br dark:from-brand-purple/25 dark:via-brand-surface/90 dark:to-brand-surface dark:shadow-glow">
          <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/25 opacity-70 blur-3xl"></div>
          <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-16 left-0 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-brand-purple/20 opacity-60 blur-3xl"></div>
          <span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-full border border-brand-purple/40 bg-brand-purple/10 px-3 py-1 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-purple shadow-sm dark:text-blue-200">
            CYSTEMS
          </span>
          <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500 dark:text-brand-mutedStrong">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-purple shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(124,60,255,0.7)]"></span>
            Modo señal
          </div>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-brand-text">
            Resumen ejecutivo
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-muted">
            Experiencia construyendo productos digitales, liderando equipos y optimizando operaciones críticas.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm dark:border-brand-purple/30 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-brand-muted">
              Arquitectura cloud
            </span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm dark:border-brand-purple/30 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-brand-muted">
              Integraciones
            </span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm dark:border-brand-purple/30 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-brand-muted">
              Producto digital
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-slate-200/70 bg-slate-50/70 py-16 dark:border-brand-purple/15 dark:bg-white/5 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1120px] px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-white/80 p-6 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10 backdrop-blur-sm dark:border-brand-purple/20 dark:bg-white/5 dark:shadow-glow">
          <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-40">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-purple/15 via-transparent to-brand-blue/10"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 grid gap-3">
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-brand-text">
              Especialidades
            </h2>
            <ul class="grid list-disc gap-3 pl-5 text-sm text-slate-600 marker:text-brand-purple/60 dark:text-brand-muted">
              <li>Arquitectura cloud para empresas y escalabilidad.</li>
              <li>Productos digitales orientados a métricas y conversión.</li>
              <li>Integraciones con APIs críticas y automatización.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-white/80 p-6 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10 backdrop-blur-sm dark:border-brand-purple/20 dark:bg-white/5 dark:shadow-glow">
          <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-40">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-purple/15 via-transparent to-brand-blue/10"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 grid gap-3">
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-brand-text">
              Disponibilidad
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-muted">
              Consultoría estratégica, mentoría técnica y acompañamiento de equipos de producto y tecnología.
            </p>
            <a
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-gradient px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-xl focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-purple/50 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-slate-50 dark:shadow-glow dark:focus-visible:ring-offset-brand-bg"
              href="/contacto"
            >
              Agendar sesión
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1120px] px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="mb-6 grid gap-3">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-500 dark:text-brand-mutedStrong">Perfil personal</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-brand-text">
          Intereses fuera del trabajo
        </h2>
        <p class="max-w-xl text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-brand-muted sm:text-lg">
          Influencias creativas que inspiran el diseño y la narrativa de producto.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="rounded-full border border-brand-purple/40 bg-brand-purple/10 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-purple shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm dark:text-blue-200">
          Anime
        </span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm dark:border-brand-purple/30 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-brand-muted">
          Videojuegos narrativos
        </span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm dark:border-brand-purple/30 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-brand-muted">
          Música instrumental
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ProfileLayout>
